Description:

A JMAP header filter condition, as used by Email/query and by Sieve's
jmapquery test, now matches header values written as RFC 2047 encoded-words.
Previously a Sieve rule like "Subject starts with ..." didn't match an
incoming message whose Subject was encoded, although it matched the same
message once stored.


